WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.950
casty: your own Farcaster read node and client.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.950
Clone the repository.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.250
(0) Compute: a server you rent or a host you have.

4
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.650
(1) A Snapchain read node: installed, synced, tunneled.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:21.950
(2) The client gets its own app key. The seed phrase is never shown.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.950
Read your feed from your node. Cast and like through it.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.950
casty web: the same feed in a browser.

8
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.950
On a phone too, from any network.

9
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.950
Write from anywhere in the feed: press n.

10
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.950
Every app key of your account, and what it may sign.

11
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.950
Reads come from your node. Writes are signed on your machine and relayed by it.

12
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.950
No API keys, no gas. castyfun.github.io/casty
